BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:'BID26: Ibero-American Design Biennial' Meeting Space — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261102T000000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261107T235959
DTSTAMP:20261102T061401Z
UID:fc3d033bd26f1773c30494c8b8c0@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:From 2 to 7 November this year\, coinciding with the Ibero-Ame
 rican Summit hosted in Madrid\, we have a new opportunity to amplify the r
 each and visibility of design from Latin America\, Portugal\, and Spain\, 
 with Madrid acting as a bridge and welcoming host city. As always\, the ev
 ent will take place at Central de Diseño / Matadero Madrid. The Ibero-Ame
 rican Design Biennial (BID) is a platform connecting design\, education\, 
 and practice across the Ibero-American context. More than just an event\, 
 it is designed as a meeting space brought to life by professionals\, stude
 nts\, academics\, businesses\, institutions\, and communities—a place to
  share processes\, exchange knowledge\, and build networks. Throu\nCategor
 y: Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/
 schedule/bid26-ibero-american-design-biennial-meeting-space
LOCATION:Central de diseño\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/bid26-ibero-american-design
 -biennial-meeting-space
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
