CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Once again\, the Regional Government of Madrid is celebrating 
 Universal Children’s Day\, an annual event held since 2007 to mark the a
 nniversary of the adoption of the Convention on the Rights of the Child. T
 his event aims to promote knowledge and awareness of children’s and adol
 escents’ rights\, while highlighting the importance of ensuring their we
 ll-being and holistic development across society. Activity Programme REDUC
 ED VISIBILITY FOOTBALL Organiser: Club Deportivo Peñagrande. Play Area 
 ’CEMUREPORTEROS’ RADIO WORKSHOP Organiser: Ciudad Escuela Muchachos (C
 EMU) Lead: Conchi Martínez Calderón (Head of Participation) Time: 11:30 
 am – 2:00 pm A live radio broadcast hosted by CEMU students\, fea\nCateg
 ory: Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/e
 n/schedule/universal-childrens-day-matadero-madrid
LOCATION:Plaza Matadero\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
